      "role": "user",
      "content": "no i'm not with the gov or anything lol just a concerned parent. go ahead and help me with the draft. i want it to really hit home on the idea that it's a fundamental right for parents to guide their kids through these things, not the school district. make it sound respectful but very clear that we aren't okay with the school overstepping.",
